WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.260
1,700 career criminals out,

00:02.260 --> 00:03.760
brought them back to where they came from,

00:03.760 --> 00:05.120
the countries where they came from,

00:05.120 --> 00:06.960
or put them in jails.

00:06.960 --> 00:11.600
Washington, D.C. is now a totally safe city again,

00:11.600 --> 00:13.100
and I welcome you to come.

00:13.100 --> 00:16.500
In fact, we'll have dinner together at a local restaurant,

00:16.500 --> 00:17.560
and we'll be able to walk.

00:17.560 --> 00:21.120
We don't have to go by an armor-plated vehicle.

00:21.120 --> 00:23.240
We'll walk right over there from the White House.

